Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "UrbanIntersectionWithYellowTaxi" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 .

:actor1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Yellow taxi driving in the center of the intersection" .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Red construction barriers on the right side of the road" .

:billboard1 a :Billboard ;
    :description "Billboard on the right side of the intersection" .

:weather1 a :ClearCondition ;
    :description "Clear weather with daylight" .

:risk1 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Yellow taxi intruding into the intersection without clear right of way" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :DistractionRisk ;
    :description "Potential distraction due to construction barriers and billboard" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Occlusion risk due to construction barriers potentially hiding pedestrians or cyclists" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.45"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.60"^^xsd:float .
```

